{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45301","headline":"赋得夜雨滴空堦送陆羽归龙山 · 皎然","name":"赋得夜雨滴空堦送陆羽归龙山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲堦夜雨滴，偏入别情中。\n断续清猨应，淋漓候馆空。\n气令烦虑散，时与早秋同。\n归客龙山道，东来杂好风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45301.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45301","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}